WEBVTT

00:00.550 --> 00:02.850
Slide the spatula down the side of the bowl,

00:03.000 --> 00:06.150
scoop underneath, and fold the batter over itself.

00:08.750 --> 00:10.850
Turn the bowl and repeat gently,

00:10.900 --> 00:13.100
scraping the bottom to catch dry flour.

00:15.050 --> 00:17.050
Stop when the dry streaks disappear.

00:17.850 --> 00:19.600
A few small lumps are fine.
